  "body": "### Description\n\nI'm running a matrix homeserver and using the element client on my OnePlus 7 Pro. The server and the client both have the latest version. Every time I'm sending a message to myself and the element client is running in the background I receive the notification within a few seconds. If I close the app the notification takes between 30 and 40 secounds. Is that because my smartphone only fetches the messages from the server every 30 seconds?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Close the app on my smartphone\r\n- Sending myself a message to the smartphone\r\n- The notification takes long time\n\n### Homeserver\n\nhomeserver\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.66.0\n\n### Installation Method\n\n_No response_\n\n### Platform\n\nThe host is an ubuntu 20.04 maschine. The homeserver is running in a docker container.\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n--- no relevant logs ---\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
